OL,3,GNEWSAPolice reassure public after dog
OL,4,Awalker's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the murder of
OL,7,Fa man whose body was found in woodland
OL,8,Fhave said mobile police stations are
OL,9,Fbeing set up to offer reassurance to
OL,10,Fthe community.
OL,12,FGraham Pennycook, 64, failed to return
OL,13,Fhome after walking his dog in woods
OL,14,Fnear the polo field, close to Perham
OL,15,FDown in Ludgershall, Wiltshire, on 24
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FWiltshire Police said his body was
OL,19,Fdiscovered later that day and a murder
OL,20,Finvestigation was launched by its Major
OL,21,FCrime Investigation Team.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
