OL,3,GNEWSAPolice reassure public after dog
OL,4,Awalker's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Phil Walker urged members
OL,7,Fof the public to approach officers "if
OL,8,Fyou feel anxious about this incident or
OL,9,Fthe subsequent heightened police
OL,10,Fpresence".
